# 6. AI in Cybersecurity  How can AI help cybersecurity professionals?  
What risks exist if AI systems make mistakes?  

Answer: 

AI can help cybersecurity professionals analyze large amounts of security data and identify unusual patterns more quickly. In this project, AI-based anomaly detection was used to identify unusual login activity. However, AI can make mistakes, create false positives, or miss real threats. For this reason, cybersecurity professionals should review AI results and use human judgment when making important security decisions.


